---
title: Đăng nhập member · nhánh thành công
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant A0 as Browser
    participant A1 as AccountLogin
    participant A2 as ModelAccountMember
    participant A3 as Cart\Member
    participant A4 as DB / Session
    A0->>A1: POST email + password → validate()
    A1->>A2: getMemberByLogin(email)
    A2->>A4: SELECT oc_member
    A1->>A3: login(email,password) nếu active + verified
    A3->>A4: SELECT member; set session token; UPDATE ip; SELECT member_ip
    A1->>A2: deleteLoginAttempts(email)
    A1->>A3: hasPin() rồi isIpVerified()
    A1->>A0: redirect PIN / security / saved redirect / account
